    worries! Everything for my favourite judge!\",\"parentUIDs\":[140],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":146},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":205}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":529.2512,\"yPos\":1904.00635},\"ID\":143,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    was able to stop them from hurting other guests and then I managed to escape,
    but they framed me for murder. It was self-defence, your honour! They were under
    the control of the satanic machine!\",\"parentUIDs\":[268],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":19},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":21}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":79.9160156,\"yPos\":2564.005},\"ID\":147,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"How
    should I get info about him?\",\"parentUIDs\":[146,159],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":151},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":152}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1883.543,\"yPos\":2726.67114},\"ID\":150,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"When
    I was little I saw a movie with lots of cowboys in it and I wanted to be just
    like them. So I started dressing this way. I hope it looks good...\",\"parentUIDs\":[149],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":154}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2138.901,\"yPos\":2917.339},\"ID\":153,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"It
    really does! You look great, man!\",\"parentUIDs\":[152],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":155}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2141.23438,\"yPos\":3095.67749},\"ID\":154,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Oh,
