    blushes and looks at you with a flustered and fond look. He really seems to have
    loved the compliment. He also seems to be interested in you.)\",\"parentUIDs\":[155],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":51},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":159}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1332.22241,\"yPos\":3114.679},\"ID\":158,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(I
    could try and flirt with him. He could give me more info like that. Or maybe
    I could even score a date! Or I could keep it professional and ask more questions.)\",\"parentUIDs\":[156],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":36}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1895.543,\"yPos\":2350.665},\"ID\":160,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(He
