    seem like a man of integrity. I believe you, Andrew.\",\"parentUIDs\":[173,182],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":177}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-703.094,\"yPos\":1384.00049},\"ID\":176,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Of
    course you do! I would never lie! I'm the most honest person you'll meet!\",\"parentUIDs\":[175],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":21},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":205}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-411.0962,\"yPos\":1389.34033},\"ID\":177,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Now
    then. Maybe I could get more info by asking him more questions. Or maybe... Maybe
