    Not even a single bit.\",\"parentUIDs\":[169],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":180}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1165.7644,\"yPos\":2377.31641},\"ID\":179,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"But
    you are wrong! I tried to protect you! And I am a man of integrity! I would never
    lie! Please! You wouldn't send an innocent man to jail, would you?\",\"parentUIDs\":[178],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":181},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":182}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1175.76831,\"yPos\":2522.65234},\"ID\":180,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(He
    does have a point. While suspicious, the evidence is super slim. And from what
    the police have showed me, there is no clear story being told by the crime scene.
    Maybe he really was just a victim. But what if he wasn't?)\",\"parentUIDs\":[179],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":185}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1429.11279,\"yPos\":2777.31567},\"ID\":183,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I'm
    noy buying this, Colmenero.\",\"parentUIDs\":[174,181],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":186}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1414.781,\"yPos\":2938.31616},\"ID\":185,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"No!
    Please! You are making a mistake!\",\"parentUIDs\":[183],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":187}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1074.43579,\"yPos\":2691.985},\"ID\":186,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Tell
    that to my sentence!\",\"parentUIDs\":[185],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":189}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1074.76929,\"yPos\":2847.656},\"ID\":187,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Noooo!\",\"parentUIDs\":[186],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":190},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":191}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1070.43726,\"yPos\":2963.9812},\"ID\":189,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(I
    will ruin this man's life...)\",\"parentUIDs\":[187],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":193}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":784.2434,\"yPos\":1869.3291},\"ID\":192,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Ok,
    Andrew. I'll give you one last chance. Impress me!\",\"parentUIDs\":[191],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":21}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":773.5781,\"yPos\":2097.98242},\"ID\":193,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Thank
    you! Thank you so much! You won't regret it!\",\"parentUIDs\":[192],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":23}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1305.10913,\"yPos\":3298.658},\"ID\":194,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"It's
    time.\",\"parentUIDs\":[190],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":270}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-686.4192,\"yPos\":3645.3103},\"ID\":198,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Andrew
    left a one-star review and was then killed.\",\"parentUIDs\":[196],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Epilogue\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":271}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-284.42334,\"yPos\":3500.65063},\"ID\":199,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Andrew
    worked for a few days at the fast food place until a customer approached him
    about how dirty the bathroom was. Enraged, he picked up a fork and killed everyone
    in the restaurant.\",\"parentUIDs\":[197],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Epilogue\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":269}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":194.250732,\"yPos\":6601.341},\"ID\":200,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Everyone
    was appalled by how corrupt you were. The news wrote about you. But you and Andrew
    didn't care. The two of you have become a powerful and dangerous couple. No one
    is safe anymore!\",\"parentUIDs\":[97],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Epilogue\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":202}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":336.5835,\"yPos\":269.9922},\"ID\":201,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Enraged
    by this, he picked one of the free plastic spoons and violently killed the staff.
    Before his sentence, he was interviewed by a local journalist. This is what he
    had to say: \\\"I will never trust ever again! Give me that ice cream!\\\"\",\"parentUIDs\":[3],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Crime
    Detail\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0.7},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":4}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":339.25,\"yPos\":381.990723},\"ID\":202,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"After
    this, he attacked the poor man and stole his hard-earned ice cream. The worst
    tragedy in the past month.\",\"parentUIDs\":[201],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Crime
    Detail\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":5}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":341.916016,\"yPos\":844.660156},\"ID\":203,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Court
    is now in session! Andrew Colmenero, you are charged with murder and assault
    of multiple people using an ice cream spoon. How do you plead?\",\"parentUIDs\":[264],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":273}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":208.251221,\"yPos\":6869.32471},\"ID\":204,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"The
    two of you have robbed banks, committed murder in restaurants and many other
    crimes. For now, though, the press is unaware you are a criminal too, but you
    have the reputation of a corrupt judge. \",\"parentUIDs\":[269],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Epilogue\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":207}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":810.581055,\"yPos\":971.3096},\"ID\":206,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Tell
    me a bit about yourself, Andrew.\",\"parentUIDs\":[205],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":209},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":210}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":823.9116,\"yPos\":1107.98145},\"ID\":207,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"What
    do you want to know?\",\"parentUIDs\":[206],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":84}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":675.25,\"yPos\":5168.649},\"ID\":208,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"What...\",\"parentUIDs\":[83],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Bailiff\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":222},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":223}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":840.583,\"yPos\":1389.99854},\"ID\":211,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I...
    I don't really like talking about it.\",\"parentUIDs\":[209],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":213}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1408.91089,\"yPos\":1277.98828},\"ID\":212,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Well...
    I work as a construction worker. But I also write poetry and post it online.\",\"parentUIDs\":[210,228],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":214}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1796.24951,\"yPos\":1153.9873},\"ID\":213,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Yes.
    Continue.\",\"parentUIDs\":[212],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":216}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2049.59326,\"yPos\":1139.9873},\"ID\":214,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    help out at a local shelter as well. I love dogs a lot and I try my best to give
    them a good life.\",\"parentUIDs\":[213],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":217}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2080.92432,\"yPos\":1339.99561},\"ID\":216,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Please.
    Continue.\",\"parentUIDs\":[214],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":218}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2086.59277,\"yPos\":1484.00635},\"ID\":217,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I...
    Have been diagnosed with anger issues. And also trust issues. But it's not major.
    I am able to remain quite calm most of the time.\",\"parentUIDs\":[216],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":219},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":220}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2169.59424,\"yPos\":1624.0083},\"ID\":218,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Ok.
    That is very useful for the case)\",\"parentUIDs\":[217],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":258}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1900.25879,\"yPos\":1710.00293},\"ID\":221,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I'm
    not sure what to talk about really. But I enjoy talking to you!\",\"parentUIDs\":[219],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":229}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":822.9155,\"yPos\":1669.34473},\"ID\":224,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    don't want to pressure you, Andrew. But it could help us for your case. Could
    you at least share a bit?\",\"parentUIDs\":[223],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":226}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1116.91553,\"yPos\":1390.66357},\"ID\":225,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Andrew
    Colmenero, you are on trial! You will do what I ask!\",\"parentUIDs\":[222],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":228},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":223}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1117.25,\"yPos\":1519.67773},\"ID\":226,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"No!
    I still have rights! I won't tell you anything!\",\"parentUIDs\":[225],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":230}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1058.917,\"yPos\":1658.00781},\"ID\":229,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"As
    a kid... I lost my parents and became an orphan at five. It was in front of a
    fast food place. A robber disguised himself as a worker. My parents realised
    this and tried to stop him. And the robber... He... He...\",\"parentUIDs\":[224],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":231}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1059.58374,\"yPos\":1797.33789},\"ID\":230,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(He
    covers his face with his hands as he starts crying)\",\"parentUIDs\":[229],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":276}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1052.58374,\"yPos\":1919.00537},\"ID\":231,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"What
    happened after?\",\"parentUIDs\":[230],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":234}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1054.25073,\"yPos\":2145.338},\"ID\":233,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"And
    then?\",\"parentUIDs\":[276],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":235}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1287.58081,\"yPos\":2071.67},\"ID\":234,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    went to an orphanage. No one picked me because I was strange they said. Those
    years were horrible. But I was able to endure it. Though... Every night I could
    see that mans face. And I swore to myself I wouldn't allow this to happen again.\",\"parentUIDs\":[233],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":236}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1552.581,\"yPos\":2042.66846},\"ID\":235,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"And
    why are you here? Why did you attack those people? You already know how evil
    taking a life is.\",\"parentUIDs\":[234],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":237}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1390.24878,\"yPos\":1920.6748},\"ID\":236,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    didn't murder them! I was trying to help them! But they were evil your honour!
    And they made sure I'd look guilty!\",\"parentUIDs\":[235],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":238}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1397.58032,\"yPos\":1807.33594},\"ID\":237,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"What
    do you mean?\",\"parentUIDs\":[236],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":146},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":243}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1363.58032,\"yPos\":1670.67822},\"ID\":238,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You
    won't believe me anyway.\",\"parentUIDs\":[237],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":210}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1662.24219,\"yPos\":1448.66846},\"ID\":244,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Thank
    you for opening up! Now. Can you please tell me more about yourself?\",\"parentUIDs\":[245],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":244}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1662.24365,\"yPos\":1584.01611},\"ID\":245,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(I
    wonder if any of that was true. But he seems very emotional. So it might be.)\",\"parentUIDs\":[243],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":247}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2596.24854,\"yPos\":1748.01221},\"ID\":246,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"What
    can you tell me about your anger issues?\",\"parentUIDs\":[220],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":256}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2598.24658,\"yPos\":1870.34668},\"ID\":247,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"If
    something reminds me of a past event it could trigger.\",\"parentUIDs\":[246],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":272}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":8.581543,\"yPos\":3500.68335},\"ID\":249,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Andrew
    was put in therapy. The therapist helped him move one from the traumatic moments
    in his childhood and understand what he has done.\",\"parentUIDs\":[248],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Epilogue\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":248}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-38.75,\"yPos\":3234.01685},\"ID\":250,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Therapy!
    You are clearly crazy and need help. After that, you'll atone for your actions.\",\"parentUIDs\":[255],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":254},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":255}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-115.416504,\"yPos\":2933.35278},\"ID\":253,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Ok...
    What to choose...)\",\"parentUIDs\":[252],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":219},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":146}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":2526.91748,\"yPos\":2052.00781},\"ID\":256,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Interesting.\",\"parentUIDs\":[247],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":259}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1677.58252,\"yPos\":1814.67383},\"ID\":258,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Oh!
    Thank you!\",\"parentUIDs\":[221],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":260}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1931.58447,\"yPos\":1870.00732},\"ID\":259,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    won't lie. It's quite strange to be put in front of a judge and cameras and made
    to open up. But it has a weirdly therapeutic effect.\",\"parentUIDs\":[258],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":261}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1667.582,\"yPos\":1927.34229},\"ID\":260,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Andrew
    blushes as he stops talking)\",\"parentUIDs\":[259],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":51},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":146}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1802.915,\"yPos\":2054.67578},\"ID\":261,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Why
    am I blushing as well?! I... I could play into this and maybe get more info from
    him. But that wouldn't be very professional. Still... He is very handsome. What
    should I do?)\",\"parentUIDs\":[260],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":263}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":228.583008,\"yPos\":1844.67432},\"ID\":262,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Everything
    seemed normal at first, but then, when I ordered, I saw the employees' eyes lit
    up with a wicked sparkle! And then they attacked me!\",\"parentUIDs\":[18],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":268}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-61.41748,\"yPos\":1953.34277},\"ID\":263,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"The
    ice cream machine was broken for months, and it requires a human sacrifice to
    work! And all the workers were like savage animals left to starve!\",\"parentUIDs\":[262],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":203}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":345.91626,\"yPos\":734.665039},\"ID\":264,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Is
    he even a cowboy or just a guy pretending to be one? Is he free tonight for a
    night of fun? Is he a murderer or misunderstood? Can I fix him? So many questions.)\",\"parentUIDs\":[110],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Judge\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":266}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-571.084,\"yPos\":1808.67188},\"ID\":265,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(You
    take a DVD and then put it into a player. A small TV glitches to life and shows
    the security footage from the restaurant.)\",\"parentUIDs\":[22],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Footage\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":136}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-576.417,\"yPos\":1931.3418},\"ID\":266,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(You
    watch as you see the friendly staff welcoming Andrew. They talk for a bit, but
    suddenly, the staff starts to yell at Andrew. They seem very upset. He picks
    up a fork...)\",\"parentUIDs\":[265],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Footage\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":15}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":191.916748,\"yPos\":1580.00684},\"ID\":267,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"So
    of course, since I am such a caring and good person, I grabbed my last few funds
    and went to the restaurant to buy an ice cream for my dog!\",\"parentUIDs\":[14],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":143}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":215.583008,\"yPos\":1963.33984},\"ID\":268,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"They
    picked me up after and were about to put me on the grill when I grabbed a fork
    and was able to fight back! \",\"parentUIDs\":[263],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":204}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":200.583008,\"yPos\":6732.675},\"ID\":269,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You
    have decided to abandon your morality and give in to your desire for bad boys.
    At least you did it for a hot one. Still, you are officially a feared man who
    isn\u2019t above crime. So it wasn\u2019t the right choice.\",\"parentUIDs\":[200],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Epilogue\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":273}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-686.4182,\"yPos\":3814.00317},\"ID\":270,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Later,
    the camera footage was repaired and showed him attacking and killing everyone
    in the restaurant after shouting about a satanist ice cream machine. You made
    the right choice. He was guilty! :)\",\"parentUIDs\":[198],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Epilogue\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":273}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-283.084473,\"yPos\":3660.66919},\"ID\":271,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"He
    has now discovered something to hate even more than spoons. Customers. And this
    time, the police weren\u2019t fast enough, so he escaped. You made the wrong
    choice. He did it again and will continue to do so as well.\",\"parentUIDs\":[199],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Epilogue\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":273}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":15.581543,\"yPos\":3666.6687},\"ID\":272,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"
    Later, on live TV he apologised and admited his crime before accepting being
    sent to jail. But just before going to jail, he donated all of his money in order
    to fund a therapy hot line for people hurt by him.\",\"parentUIDs\":[249],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Epilogue\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":233}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":1053.5,\"yPos\":2014},\"ID\":276,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"It
    turned out the robber was part of a satanic cult and was trying to get funding
    for it. And also sacrifices by luring people and killing them in the backroom.\",\"parentUIDs\":[231],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"andrew\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0}]}"
